id: flash-signature
section: The suite's own
item: A screen is recognised by a stored signature: the same screen matches in separate runs, another screen does not
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-plant-reacts.swf
kit: cavekit-flash.md R2
wait rect m 30
wait still m 8
sig-save plant-reacts-rest m
expect screen m plant-reacts-rest same
dismiss 200 250
wait still m 8
expect screen m plant-reacts-rest other
